Error [E0102]: Nothing named `x` exists here
  --> tests/ui/not_a_function.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     x(2)
    |     ^
 Why: Only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print` / `input`) can be called
 Fix: Define it first (fn x() { ... }), or call one that exists
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
